<v Saidu Tejan-Thomas Jr.>But that's what parents tell you to do. You know what I'm saying? Like, wait, something bad is happening? Call the cops.
<v Saidu Tejan-Thomas Jr.>但这正是父母会告诉你去做的。你知道我的意思吗？比如，等一下，发生了糟糕的事情？报警。

